(4227479, 609946, 48086, '<td valign="top">good shot, the colors work very well, the light is good, the subject is funny, only the popcorn itself seems simple, perhaps some more would enhance. nevertheless one of the best of this challenge 8</td>', 'good shot, the colors work very well, the light is good, the subject is funny, only the popcorn itself seems simple, perhaps some more would enhance. nevertheless one of the best of this challenge 8', '2007-11-07 05:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
