(4227667, 608570, 53147, '<td valign="top">Clean, balanced, great color, good use of negative space. This is on eof my top picks for the challenge. Good luck!</td>', 'Clean, balanced, great color, good use of negative space. This is on eof my top picks for the challenge. Good luck!', '2007-11-07 07:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4227668, 608383, 53147, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this image. Nice bokeh, pleasing muted colors. Just a very nice image overall without the campy feel of many of the other entries. One of my top picks. Goodluck!</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this image. Nice bokeh, pleasing muted colors. Just a very nice image overall without the campy feel of many of the other entries. One of my top picks. Goodluck!', '2007-11-07 07:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4227701, 609617, 78445, '<td valign="top">Wow but did it go in. Great shot 10!!!!</td>', 'Wow but did it go in. Great shot 10!!!!', '2007-11-07 08:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4227766, 609818, 16488, '<td valign="top">I really feel that you''re making the title do too much work to fit the challenge...and I''m not convinced of its assertion, either.<br/> <br/>I do like the character in the man''s clothes and age-worn face. Highlights seem a little blown out, especially on the hair. The flag in the foreground wouldn''t be so awful an intrusion if it didn''t also intersect with the subject''s boots.</td>', 'I really feel that you''re making the title do too much work to fit the challenge...and I''m not convinced of its assertion, either. I do like the character in the man''s clothes and age-worn face. Highlights seem a little blown out, especially on the hair. The flag in the foreground wouldn''t be so awful an intrusion if it didn''t also intersect with the subject''s boots.', '2007-11-07 08:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4227776, 608099, 86105, '<td valign="top">And all those corn fields I pass every day, I never saw this connection... good job.</td>', 'And all those corn fields I pass every day, I never saw this connection... good job.', '2007-11-07 08:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4227783, 606874, 16488, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really say "popcorn" to me.<br/> <br/>I like the color of these buds. However, the composition feels unbalanced. The background is busy. The frame is cramped. Depth of field is shallow but perhaps too shallow since the second (slightly out of focus) bud is almost equal in size to the other they compete for attention...force one entirely back or give them equal treatment to mirror the other.</td>', 'Doesn''t really say "popcorn" to me. I like the color of these buds. However, the composition feels unbalanced. The background is busy. The frame is cramped. Depth of field is shallow but perhaps too shallow since the second (slightly out of focus) bud is almost equal in size to the other they compete for attention...force one entirely back or give them equal treatment to mirror the other.', '2007-11-07 08:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4227785, 609574, 86105, '<td valign="top">very very clever and creative.  Nice job!</td>', 'very very clever and creative.  Nice job!', '2007-11-07 08:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4227788, 609656, 86105, '<td valign="top">Imaginative thinking.  well done.</td>', 'Imaginative thinking.  well done.', '2007-11-07 08:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4227789, 609961, 16488, '<td valign="top">Lovely light! It really shows the beauty of the model''s skin. Pose is fun and the image is playful. Lots to like here!<br/>(BTW, after the challenge I hope you''ll tell us just how much popcorn that is.)</td>', 'Lovely light! It really shows the beauty of the model''s skin. Pose is fun and the image is playful. Lots to like here!(BTW, after the challenge I hope you''ll tell us just how much popcorn that is.)', '2007-11-07 08:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
