(4227807, 608968, 16488, '<td valign="top">Messy, fine. Popcorn distinguishable, not so much. But what really hurts this image is the harsh shadows. Sorry.</td>', 'Messy, fine. Popcorn distinguishable, not so much. But what really hurts this image is the harsh shadows. Sorry.', '2007-11-07 08:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
