(4227875, 608439, 14593, '<td valign="top">cute idea...a different approach I can appreciate---one of the best acutally....you should ribbon with this effort if it were up to me!</td>', 'cute idea...a different approach I can appreciate---one of the best acutally....you should ribbon with this effort if it were up to me!', '2007-11-07 09:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
