(4234150, 608159, 70689, '<td valign="top">This looks squeezed or something? Aren''t baby''s heads supposed to be approximately round? This looks very unnatural.</td>', 'This looks squeezed or something? Aren''t baby''s heads supposed to be approximately round? This looks very unnatural.', '2007-11-09 08:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234153, 609287, 70689, '<td valign="top">Please do not use your onboard flash for these kind of pictures, and if you do, reflect it (piece of paper or mirror) or diffuse it (tissue). The flash realy spoils your picture. It causes dull eyes, hars shadows, a harsh reflection in the bowl and very uneven lighting between fore- and background. (3)</td>', 'Please do not use your onboard flash for these kind of pictures, and if you do, reflect it (piece of paper or mirror) or diffuse it (tissue). The flash realy spoils your picture. It causes dull eyes, hars shadows, a harsh reflection in the bowl and very uneven lighting between fore- and background. (3)', '2007-11-09 08:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234154, 609961, 70689, '<td valign="top">Great (9)</td>', 'Great (9)', '2007-11-09 08:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234157, 608607, 70689, '<td valign="top">Well caught. I love the expression on her face. One can see her thinking to herself: "I am not afraid of pigeons, I am not afraid of pigeons, I am not afraid of pigeons, I am not afraid of pigeons, I am not afraid of pigeons" (8)</td>', 'Well caught. I love the expression on her face. One can see her thinking to herself: "I am not afraid of pigeons, I am not afraid of pigeons, I am not afraid of pigeons, I am not afraid of pigeons, I am not afraid of pigeons" (8)', '2007-11-09 08:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234161, 609899, 70689, '<td valign="top">Watch out little fella, there''s a big hairy spider crawling around there somewhere.<br/> <br/>Love it. Surprising, great sharpness, lighting and color. This one rocks (9)</td>', 'Watch out little fella, there''s a big hairy spider crawling around there somewhere. Love it. Surprising, great sharpness, lighting and color. This one rocks (9)', '2007-11-09 08:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234163, 609610, 70689, '<td valign="top">Nice take, but the harsh shadows spoil everything. (4)</td>', 'Nice take, but the harsh shadows spoil everything. (4)', '2007-11-09 08:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234167, 609776, 70689, '<td valign="top">Pictyure is a bit too dark, turning the pan into one big black lump en the popcorn into something greyish. Harsh shadows are not my cup of tea either. (4)</td>', 'Pictyure is a bit too dark, turning the pan into one big black lump en the popcorn into something greyish. Harsh shadows are not my cup of tea either. (4)', '2007-11-09 08:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234170, 609883, 70689, '<td valign="top">Nice. Great concept, well executed (8, no 9)</td>', 'Nice. Great concept, well executed (8, no 9)', '2007-11-09 08:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234200, 606898, 79720, '<td valign="top">I do like the colours and odd crop, but the on-board flash lighting did not help at all.</td>', 'I do like the colours and odd crop, but the on-board flash lighting did not help at all.', '2007-11-09 08:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234209, 609820, 79720, '<td valign="top">Yikes.<br/> <br/>Me: "Let''s play word association."<br/>You: "OK."<br/>Me: "Popcorn."<br/>You: "Tarantula."<br/>Me: "........."<br/>You: "Excuse me, I need to go refill my meds."</td>', 'Yikes. Me: "Let''s play word association."You: "OK."Me: "Popcorn."You: "Tarantula."Me: "........."You: "Excuse me, I need to go refill my meds."', '2007-11-09 08:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234213, 609431, 65234, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  Can''t say as I really like the composition for this challenge.  I''ve played the game with my kids, but as a way to create an image that makes the viewer immediately think of popcorn it doesn''t work for me.  The popcorn is overwhelmed by the busyness of the other objects, IMO.</td>', 'Hmm.  Can''t say as I really like the composition for this challenge.  I''ve played the game with my kids, but as a way to create an image that makes the viewer immediately think of popcorn it doesn''t work for me.  The popcorn is overwhelmed by the busyness of the other objects, IMO.', '2007-11-09 08:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234214, 609466, 79720, '<td valign="top">A great idea. The lighting has left a bit of a bluish cast.</td>', 'A great idea. The lighting has left a bit of a bluish cast.', '2007-11-09 08:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234218, 608735, 79720, '<td valign="top">Adequate macro, great title.</td>', 'Adequate macro, great title.', '2007-11-09 08:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234221, 608972, 65234, '<td valign="top">Popcorn in a flower?  And creating a nice lion-face.  Different.</td>', 'Popcorn in a flower?  And creating a nice lion-face.  Different.', '2007-11-09 08:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234230, 609852, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice popper :-)  Good choice of elements to convey your idea without making it too busy (the Coke and popper both being red is nicely harmonious so the popcorn isn''t overwhelmed).</td>', 'Nice popper :-)  Good choice of elements to convey your idea without making it too busy (the Coke and popper both being red is nicely harmonious so the popcorn isn''t overwhelmed).', '2007-11-09 08:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234236, 609938, 65234, '<td valign="top">I cannot imagine where you found this!  Nice idea for the challenge and probably unique (I just started voting so I can''t be sure yet).</td>', 'I cannot imagine where you found this!  Nice idea for the challenge and probably unique (I just started voting so I can''t be sure yet).', '2007-11-09 08:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234242, 608571, 65234, '<td valign="top">That looks incredibly unappetizing to me, but then I am not a big fan of grease.</td>', 'That looks incredibly unappetizing to me, but then I am not a big fan of grease.', '2007-11-09 08:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234245, 609961, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lots of popcorn; model looks quite plastic to me.</td>', 'Lots of popcorn; model looks quite plastic to me.', '2007-11-09 08:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234251, 608656, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the idea and DOF and lighting work for it; I''m finding her ear a little distracting.  Might like to see a hand (hers grabbing or yours defending the popcorn, or both) to give this a little more impact.</td>', 'Like the idea and DOF and lighting work for it; I''m finding her ear a little distracting.  Might like to see a hand (hers grabbing or yours defending the popcorn, or both) to give this a little more impact.', '2007-11-09 08:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234253, 609952, 65234, '<td valign="top">I think I''d like this much better for this challenge if you had included some popcorn, popped or even in the package.  Lighting on the movies is a bit harsh.</td>', 'I think I''d like this much better for this challenge if you had included some popcorn, popped or even in the package.  Lighting on the movies is a bit harsh.', '2007-11-09 08:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234255, 609287, 65234, '<td valign="top">The dog''s expression is cute.  Flash reflection in his eyes and general lighting are quite harsh; I would try a bounced flash or diffuse it if it''s the only light you have.  Also, you could probably crop out the desk leg and wires to draw more attention to your subject.</td>', 'The dog''s expression is cute.  Flash reflection in his eyes and general lighting are quite harsh; I would try a bounced flash or diffuse it if it''s the only light you have.  Also, you could probably crop out the desk leg and wires to draw more attention to your subject.', '2007-11-09 08:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234268, 608159, 65234, '<td valign="top">Adorable idea, but it looks like you resized without maintaing the same proportions as the larger image so the baby''s head looks stretched upwards (or compressed sideways).  Also, I would crop so the baby wasn''t quite so centered and leave a bit more headroom.</td>', 'Adorable idea, but it looks like you resized without maintaing the same proportions as the larger image so the baby''s head looks stretched upwards (or compressed sideways).  Also, I would crop so the baby wasn''t quite so centered and leave a bit more headroom.', '2007-11-09 08:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234272, 609281, 65234, '<td valign="top">Bonus point for creativity!  Lighting is fun and works well with your theme.</td>', 'Bonus point for creativity!  Lighting is fun and works well with your theme.', '2007-11-09 09:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234275, 609609, 65234, '<td valign="top">Wonderful squirrel picture, but a stretch for this challenge.  I bet he would have happily eaten popcorn!</td>', 'Wonderful squirrel picture, but a stretch for this challenge.  I bet he would have happily eaten popcorn!', '2007-11-09 09:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234277, 609755, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition; I like how you packed the ears.</td>', 'Interesting composition; I like how you packed the ears.', '2007-11-09 09:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234279, 608816, 65234, '<td valign="top">The popcorn in front of the bowl is artfully arranged and I like the piece hanging off the bowl.  DOF works but I would crop much tighter on top to keep just the bowl and popcorn in the shot.</td>', 'The popcorn in front of the bowl is artfully arranged and I like the piece hanging off the bowl.  DOF works but I would crop much tighter on top to keep just the bowl and popcorn in the shot.', '2007-11-09 09:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234284, 606874, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting flower and composition but a bit of a stretch for this challenge IMO.  I am seeing a lot of sharpening hotspots on the flowers and some on the upper left part of the stem.</td>', 'Interesting flower and composition but a bit of a stretch for this challenge IMO.  I am seeing a lot of sharpening hotspots on the flowers and some on the upper left part of the stem.', '2007-11-09 09:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234286, 608383, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and DOF and interesting idea.</td>', 'Nice composition and DOF and interesting idea.', '2007-11-09 09:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234289, 608607, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely little girl and cute shot.  My favorite so far :-)</td>', 'Lovely little girl and cute shot.  My favorite so far :-)', '2007-11-09 09:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234294, 608833, 65234, '<td valign="top">Simple composition with actual popcorn (thank you!), lighting and DOF are nice.  I might move the popcorn on top of the other "p" to get it less centered.</td>', 'Simple composition with actual popcorn (thank you!), lighting and DOF are nice.  I might move the popcorn on top of the other "p" to get it less centered.', '2007-11-09 09:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234298, 609820, 65234, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe I am running into a spider in a popcorn challenge :::shudder:::  That''s just mean!  But reasonably lit and composed and all that.</td>', 'I can''t believe I am running into a spider in a popcorn challenge :::shudder:::  That''s just mean!  But reasonably lit and composed and all that.', '2007-11-09 09:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234299, 607598, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very cute and nicely composed.</td>', 'Very cute and nicely composed.', '2007-11-09 09:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234301, 608570, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice; I like that you included the flame and I even like the centered popping kernel.  Just the right amount of negative space for the composition.</td>', 'Nice; I like that you included the flame and I even like the centered popping kernel.  Just the right amount of negative space for the composition.', '2007-11-09 09:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234589, 609610, 85155, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is too harsh.  It is especially obvious because of the shadows formed by the flash.  Try to use the natural lighting instead, if it is too dark do it at a different time of day with non-direct sunlight coming in from one of the sides.  Another way to avoid the shadows is to have everything further away from the wall, so the shadows fall lower and they don''t show up in the picture.  Also, the checker board really blends in with the table.  Try not to have so much wasted space at the top either.</td>', 'The lighting here is too harsh.  It is especially obvious because of the shadows formed by the flash.  Try to use the natural lighting instead, if it is too dark do it at a different time of day with non-direct sunlight coming in from one of the sides.  Another way to avoid the shadows is to have everything further away from the wall, so the shadows fall lower and they don''t show up in the picture.  Also, the checker board really blends in with the table.  Try not to have so much wasted space at the top either.', '2007-11-09 11:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234596, 609335, 85155, '<td valign="top">This picture is too symmetrical to me, even the lone pieces in front are almost symmetrical.  Try a different angle, or moving the bowl to a third, or something else to get a more interesting pov.  Too much symmetry, usually doesn''t work well.  I really like the nice simple, contrasting, background.  And I think the reflection off the able is nice.</td>', 'This picture is too symmetrical to me, even the lone pieces in front are almost symmetrical.  Try a different angle, or moving the bowl to a third, or something else to get a more interesting pov.  Too much symmetry, usually doesn''t work well.  I really like the nice simple, contrasting, background.  And I think the reflection off the able is nice.', '2007-11-09 11:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234599, 609922, 85155, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting idea, nicely done.  I wish there wasn''t so much wasted space at top though.  I like that the popcorn kernels are different colors, but usually with fireworks there is some kind of pattern to things, the colors here just look random.  I really like the trails though.</td>', 'This is an interesting idea, nicely done.  I wish there wasn''t so much wasted space at top though.  I like that the popcorn kernels are different colors, but usually with fireworks there is some kind of pattern to things, the colors here just look random.  I really like the trails though.', '2007-11-09 11:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234600, 609215, 85155, '<td valign="top">Nice use of dof in this shot.  I''m not sure what the red and green are doing here.  I think it would have a better affect if the entire kernel was a different color, rather than just some specs.  The composition is nicely done though.</td>', 'Nice use of dof in this shot.  I''m not sure what the red and green are doing here.  I think it would have a better affect if the entire kernel was a different color, rather than just some specs.  The composition is nicely done though.', '2007-11-09 11:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234601, 608968, 85155, '<td valign="top">I think the colors in this shot are great, the nice blue eyes in the boy really bring this shot to life.  That looks like a big mess to clean up.</td>', 'I think the colors in this shot are great, the nice blue eyes in the boy really bring this shot to life.  That looks like a big mess to clean up.', '2007-11-09 11:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234605, 609871, 85155, '<td valign="top">This shot doesn''t seem like a lot of thought went into it.  It is a little too busy for me, and I think that you should have all the kernels in focus.  The shadow is also distracting.  This shot is just really bland.</td>', 'This shot doesn''t seem like a lot of thought went into it.  It is a little too busy for me, and I think that you should have all the kernels in focus.  The shadow is also distracting.  This shot is just really bland.', '2007-11-09 11:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234610, 609504, 26001, '<td valign="top">nice idea and perspective. i think it could have looked better with the lighter just standing on its own (without the right hand). still one of my favorites of the challenge because of the concept.<br/>correction: well duh! how can a lighter stand on its own and be lit at the same time? i should have said, candle could have been an alternative :)</td>', 'nice idea and perspective. i think it could have looked better with the lighter just standing on its own (without the right hand). still one of my favorites of the challenge because of the concept.correction: well duh! how can a lighter stand on its own and be lit at the same time? i should have said, candle could have been an alternative :)', '2007-11-09 11:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234612, 609734, 3746, '<td valign="top">Very dull shot that doesn''t inspire me in anyway. it meets the challenge but thats about it.<br/> <br/>3</td>', 'Very dull shot that doesn''t inspire me in anyway. it meets the challenge but thats about it. 3', '2007-11-09 11:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234613, 609635, 3746, '<td valign="top">It meets the challenge but other than that doesnt do much else. technically average.</td>', 'It meets the challenge but other than that doesnt do much else. technically average.', '2007-11-09 11:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234637, 609364, 85155, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why you chose the b&amp;w conversion here.  I would have loved to see the red rocks.  This doesn''t really remind me of popcorn, I think it would have met the challenge if it did, but it doesn''t to me, sorry.</td>', 'I''m not sure why you chose the b&w conversion here.  I would have loved to see the red rocks.  This doesn''t really remind me of popcorn, I think it would have met the challenge if it did, but it doesn''t to me, sorry.', '2007-11-09 12:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234639, 608465, 85155, '<td valign="top">I like how the dog is looking up like, is anybody gonna get mad at me.  Nice colors, this is very vibrant.</td>', 'I like how the dog is looking up like, is anybody gonna get mad at me.  Nice colors, this is very vibrant.', '2007-11-09 12:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234640, 609691, 85155, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a bad shot, but it seems to obvious to me.  The winner of this challenge is going to do something unique with their popcorn, rather than just what you see every day.</td>', 'This isn''t a bad shot, but it seems to obvious to me.  The winner of this challenge is going to do something unique with their popcorn, rather than just what you see every day.', '2007-11-09 12:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234642, 609938, 85155, '<td valign="top">This shot needs a better pov.  The straight on, symmetrical shot losses my interest.  Try taking this from an angle and see if it improves.</td>', 'This shot needs a better pov.  The straight on, symmetrical shot losses my interest.  Try taking this from an angle and see if it improves.', '2007-11-09 12:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234646, 608249, 85155, '<td valign="top">Nice unique idea here.  I like the dof which makes the background more simple.</td>', 'Nice unique idea here.  I like the dof which makes the background more simple.', '2007-11-09 12:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234650, 609880, 85155, '<td valign="top">This picture isn''t as sharp as I would like it to be.  Try using a higher f-stop so everything is in focus.  What is that blue thing in the top right?  That is distracting to me.</td>', 'This picture isn''t as sharp as I would like it to be.  Try using a higher f-stop so everything is in focus.  What is that blue thing in the top right?  That is distracting to me.', '2007-11-09 12:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234652, 609387, 85155, '<td valign="top">This shot doesn''t hold much interest to me.  The drawing on the bag isn''t that great, and the shot is very flat, especially since it really is just a flat subject.  I''m sure you can come up with something more interesting.</td>', 'This shot doesn''t hold much interest to me.  The drawing on the bag isn''t that great, and the shot is very flat, especially since it really is just a flat subject.  I''m sure you can come up with something more interesting.', '2007-11-09 12:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234656, 609188, 85155, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective here.  What is the popcorn dreaming about?  Being blown up, or flying away?  Makes me think, nicely done.</td>', 'I like the perspective here.  What is the popcorn dreaming about?  Being blown up, or flying away?  Makes me think, nicely done.', '2007-11-09 12:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234657, 608383, 85155, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity in this shot.  I think I would have given it a higher rating if I hadn''t already seen a really similar picture though.  I really like the dof too.</td>', 'I like the simplicity in this shot.  I think I would have given it a higher rating if I hadn''t already seen a really similar picture though.  I really like the dof too.', '2007-11-09 12:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234658, 606928, 85155, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of Australia, the top of the map is a little out of focus though.  Try using a higher f-stop so everything is tack sharp.  I like the different colors.</td>', 'Nice shot of Australia, the top of the map is a little out of focus though.  Try using a higher f-stop so everything is tack sharp.  I like the different colors.', '2007-11-09 12:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234670, 609204, 85155, '<td valign="top">This shot could be a lot better if it wasn''t centered.  The use of dof is great to make the background simple, you didn''t cut off the arm on a joint, a lot of great things in this shot.  Just work on the composition to make it more interesting.</td>', 'This shot could be a lot better if it wasn''t centered.  The use of dof is great to make the background simple, you didn''t cut off the arm on a joint, a lot of great things in this shot.  Just work on the composition to make it more interesting.', '2007-11-09 12:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234672, 609818, 85155, '<td valign="top">You could have at least tried to incorporate popcorn.  If you have to use the title to convince me it meets the challenge, it probably doesn''t.<br/> <br/>Aside from that, the flag in the bottom is distracting, try taking this from another angle to get that out of your shot, cropping it out might hurt the picture.  I really like the reflections on the memorial from the other people, and your subject holds interest.</td>', 'You could have at least tried to incorporate popcorn.  If you have to use the title to convince me it meets the challenge, it probably doesn''t. Aside from that, the flag in the bottom is distracting, try taking this from another angle to get that out of your shot, cropping it out might hurt the picture.  I really like the reflections on the memorial from the other people, and your subject holds interest.', '2007-11-09 12:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234679, 609899, 58452, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  Love the pose. My pick for the blue.</td>', 'Very creative.  Love the pose. My pick for the blue.', '2007-11-09 12:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234681, 609063, 58452, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the expressions and the tongue out.  LOL Just a tad more exposure onthe faces would be nice, but that''s just a nit pik.</td>', 'Nice capture of the expressions and the tongue out.  LOL Just a tad more exposure onthe faces would be nice, but that''s just a nit pik.', '2007-11-09 12:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234682, 609895, 58452, '<td valign="top">Good blur on the pop.  A different perspective with a solid background might work better.</td>', 'Good blur on the pop.  A different perspective with a solid background might work better.', '2007-11-09 12:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234684, 609281, 58452, '<td valign="top">Nice bold colors, but for me the darker colored pops just don''t work.</td>', 'Nice bold colors, but for me the darker colored pops just don''t work.', '2007-11-09 12:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234686, 609961, 58452, '<td valign="top">Interesting pose.  You can get sick from eating too much pop corn.  LOL  Hope she took a shower!</td>', 'Interesting pose.  You can get sick from eating too much pop corn.  LOL  Hope she took a shower!', '2007-11-09 12:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234690, 609938, 58452, '<td valign="top">Camera could have shifted slightly to the right to perfectly center the hood.</td>', 'Camera could have shifted slightly to the right to perfectly center the hood.', '2007-11-09 12:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234691, 608439, 58452, '<td valign="top">Cute!  Lovely happy expression.</td>', 'Cute!  Lovely happy expression.', '2007-11-09 12:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234693, 609898, 58452, '<td valign="top">Art?  This you?  So this is what the voices suggested?  Nice color contrasts, just a tad shiny on the woody, but it doesn''t detract from the composition.  Very nice.</td>', 'Art?  This you?  So this is what the voices suggested?  Nice color contrasts, just a tad shiny on the woody, but it doesn''t detract from the composition.  Very nice.', '2007-11-09 12:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234694, 609788, 58452, '<td valign="top">Looks like it''s just before the popcorn flew!</td>', 'Looks like it''s just before the popcorn flew!', '2007-11-09 12:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234695, 609940, 79720, '<td valign="top">I do like light-on-white images, but there needs to be a touch more contrast to make this really compelling.</td>', 'I do like light-on-white images, but there needs to be a touch more contrast to make this really compelling.', '2007-11-09 12:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234696, 608607, 58452, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a very colorful and pretty outfit.</td>', 'Nice capture of a very colorful and pretty outfit.', '2007-11-09 12:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234697, 607598, 58452, '<td valign="top">Hope all the oil came off!  LOL<br/>Nice composition.</td>', 'Hope all the oil came off!  LOLNice composition.', '2007-11-09 12:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4234699, 609215, 79720, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, well-executed. The red kernel seems a little bright/oversaturated.</td>', 'Nice idea, well-executed. The red kernel seems a little bright/oversaturated.', '2007-11-09 12:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
