(4236645, 609281, 67697, '<td valign="top">Cute and creative idea. The title is perfect! Hope it does well because it is so different.  The only distraction for me is the red tinge around the shadow of the purple popcorn.  Good luck!</td>', 'Cute and creative idea. The title is perfect! Hope it does well because it is so different.  The only distraction for me is the red tinge around the shadow of the purple popcorn.  Good luck!', '2007-11-10 08:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4236651, 609788, 67697, '<td valign="top">So sweet.  What a good doggy!  lol if I did this set up with my dogs, my pic would have looked like a scene from JAWS with dog leaping and mouth wide open.  Love the lighting and detail on the dog.</td>', 'So sweet.  What a good doggy!  lol if I did this set up with my dogs, my pic would have looked like a scene from JAWS with dog leaping and mouth wide open.  Love the lighting and detail on the dog.', '2007-11-10 08:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4236653, 608570, 67697, '<td valign="top">Great set-up and I love the cropping and composition.</td>', 'Great set-up and I love the cropping and composition.', '2007-11-10 08:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4236656, 609883, 67697, '<td valign="top">Should I admit that I was compelled to count and compare the gaps in corn with the number of popcorn? lol  <br/> <br/>Love the floating popcorn but the little white piece on the upper left is a distraction.  Nice and creative idea - good luck!</td>', 'Should I admit that I was compelled to count and compare the gaps in corn with the number of popcorn? lol   Love the floating popcorn but the little white piece on the upper left is a distraction.  Nice and creative idea - good luck!', '2007-11-10 08:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4236664, 608249, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like this in black and white and that you didn''t lose a lot of detail on the popcorn.  I think I would have liked to have seen more of the branches so the popcorn in the back was not cropped and that there was a little more space for the one on the left corner.</td>', 'I like this in black and white and that you didn''t lose a lot of detail on the popcorn.  I think I would have liked to have seen more of the branches so the popcorn in the back was not cropped and that there was a little more space for the one on the left corner.', '2007-11-10 08:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
