(4238064, 609549, 73452, '<td valign="top">I think it''d look better in color with some great yellows.</td>', 'I think it''d look better in color with some great yellows.', '2007-11-11 00:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238082, 608968, 20330, '<td valign="top">love the look on his face. the eyes are mesmerizing, naturally beautiful without a bunch of photoshop. nice focus, etc.. good job :)</td>', 'love the look on his face. the eyes are mesmerizing, naturally beautiful without a bunch of photoshop. nice focus, etc.. good job :)', '2007-11-11 00:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238087, 608383, 20330, '<td valign="top">I only give one 10 every challenge, you got mine. You thought outside the box, took something as boring as popcorn and turned it into a work of art. The rule of thirds composition is stunning, the background coloring is subdued and makes the subject stand out, the subject is interesting, and the dof is spot on. Good Job :)</td>', 'I only give one 10 every challenge, you got mine. You thought outside the box, took something as boring as popcorn and turned it into a work of art. The rule of thirds composition is stunning, the background coloring is subdued and makes the subject stand out, the subject is interesting, and the dof is spot on. Good Job :)', '2007-11-11 00:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238112, 608465, 41337, '<td valign="top">The dog''s expression is priceless. It almost seems like he/she knows this is some kind of trick.</td>', 'The dog''s expression is priceless. It almost seems like he/she knows this is some kind of trick.', '2007-11-11 01:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238116, 609574, 41337, '<td valign="top">Funny. The idea is pretty well executed. The technicals could be a little better (color cast, highlights a tad too bright) but overall not bad.</td>', 'Funny. The idea is pretty well executed. The technicals could be a little better (color cast, highlights a tad too bright) but overall not bad.', '2007-11-11 01:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238125, 609691, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like that you focused on the texture with this close up. However, the lighting needs some work to bring out those textures more. Try using a light source that you can place at a 45 degree angle of the subject so you can get some shadows going, which is what makes the little lines and crevices in the texture stand out. Since this subject is small you may need to make your light source smaller as well perhaps creating a snoot (a long tube in front of the light) to narrow the beam. Anyway, just an idea. Good luck!</td>', 'I like that you focused on the texture with this close up. However, the lighting needs some work to bring out those textures more. Try using a light source that you can place at a 45 degree angle of the subject so you can get some shadows going, which is what makes the little lines and crevices in the texture stand out. Since this subject is small you may need to make your light source smaller as well perhaps creating a snoot (a long tube in front of the light) to narrow the beam. Anyway, just an idea. Good luck!', '2007-11-11 01:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238127, 608816, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good use of DOF here. You probably would have been better off cropping the top off. Blown out backgrounds can work but here it created some odd artifacts, which detract from the shot, IMO.</td>', 'Good use of DOF here. You probably would have been better off cropping the top off. Blown out backgrounds can work but here it created some odd artifacts, which detract from the shot, IMO.', '2007-11-11 01:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238129, 609871, 41337, '<td valign="top">Strong focus on the popcorn but it''s a bit too static and ordinary. Perhaps shooting from underneath the popcorn, say under a glass table and showing a hand reaching for it would have upped the wow factor. Also, watch your exposure. The highlights are a bit too bright. I might try diffusing the light more so it''s not so harsh.</td>', 'Strong focus on the popcorn but it''s a bit too static and ordinary. Perhaps shooting from underneath the popcorn, say under a glass table and showing a hand reaching for it would have upped the wow factor. Also, watch your exposure. The highlights are a bit too bright. I might try diffusing the light more so it''s not so harsh.', '2007-11-11 01:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238133, 609852, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp image. The main thing holding this back is the composition. It''s just not engaging enough at this angle. Perhaps a slightly raised view with a diagonal composition might generate some leading lines to guide the eye.</td>', 'Nice sharp image. The main thing holding this back is the composition. It''s just not engaging enough at this angle. Perhaps a slightly raised view with a diagonal composition might generate some leading lines to guide the eye.', '2007-11-11 01:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238138, 609210, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the movement and the nostalgic feel of the photograph.</td>', 'I like the movement and the nostalgic feel of the photograph.', '2007-11-11 01:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238146, 609204, 41337, '<td valign="top">Simple is good but your technicals, namely your exposure (too underexposed) and composition (too static) held you back. One thing that might have given this more energy is a diagonal composition. For example. have the arm enter the top left corner and extend towards the bottom right corner and frame it portrait style. In other words, the hand would be extending towards the viewer rather than away. The diagonal composition would elongate the arm and enhance the "giving/receiving" aspect to the shot. If you brought the camera down a bit you could then give it a shallow DOF by shooting with a wide aperture to create a focal point for the eyes to gravitate to.</td>', 'Simple is good but your technicals, namely your exposure (too underexposed) and composition (too static) held you back. One thing that might have given this more energy is a diagonal composition. For example. have the arm enter the top left corner and extend towards the bottom right corner and frame it portrait style. In other words, the hand would be extending towards the viewer rather than away. The diagonal composition would elongate the arm and enhance the "giving/receiving" aspect to the shot. If you brought the camera down a bit you could then give it a shallow DOF by shooting with a wide aperture to create a focal point for the eyes to gravitate to.', '2007-11-11 02:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238150, 609938, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp but the composition feels a little awkward with the headlights cropped like that.</td>', 'Nice and sharp but the composition feels a little awkward with the headlights cropped like that.', '2007-11-11 02:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238156, 609794, 41337, '<td valign="top">The tight crop helps convey the addiction (i.e. having too much) aspect. The lighting could be better as well as the surface/background choice. A darker background would have help make the popcorn stand out more.</td>', 'The tight crop helps convey the addiction (i.e. having too much) aspect. The lighting could be better as well as the surface/background choice. A darker background would have help make the popcorn stand out more.', '2007-11-11 02:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238159, 609788, 41337, '<td valign="top">Cute. I wish I could see the eyes though.</td>', 'Cute. I wish I could see the eyes though.', '2007-11-11 02:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238160, 609063, 41337, '<td valign="top">Cute photo. A spot light in the background where that popcorn is would have really given this shot some added punch. Just a thought.</td>', 'Cute photo. A spot light in the background where that popcorn is would have really given this shot some added punch. Just a thought.', '2007-11-11 02:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238162, 609617, 41337, '<td valign="top">Ha. Looks fairly believable but next time ask Qart or Larus for a cuter (and more female) model. :P</td>', 'Ha. Looks fairly believable but next time ask Qart or Larus for a cuter (and more female) model. :P', '2007-11-11 02:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238165, 607598, 41337, '<td valign="top">Too cute. For some reason that little hole on the left side (at nose level) bothers me a little. If I were you I''d clone in a popcorn there so then you could get DQed. :P</td>', 'Too cute. For some reason that little hole on the left side (at nose level) bothers me a little. If I were you I''d clone in a popcorn there so then you could get DQed. :P', '2007-11-11 02:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238167, 609940, 30490, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but the kernels are too blown out in my opinion.  An overall good effort though - 5</td>', 'Great idea, but the kernels are too blown out in my opinion.  An overall good effort though - 5', '2007-11-11 02:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238168, 608656, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the POV you''ve chosen here. I also like the use of a narrow DOF but for me the focus is on the wrong area. I would have liked it better if the focus was on the girl''s eyes or at the very least the entire bowl was in focus rather than just the back end of it.</td>', 'I like the POV you''ve chosen here. I also like the use of a narrow DOF but for me the focus is on the wrong area. I would have liked it better if the focus was on the girl''s eyes or at the very least the entire bowl was in focus rather than just the back end of it.', '2007-11-11 02:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238170, 609610, 30490, '<td valign="top">Harsh lighting = shadows.  I am still trying to figure this out in my photos too.  Great idea overall though.</td>', 'Harsh lighting = shadows.  I am still trying to figure this out in my photos too.  Great idea overall though.', '2007-11-11 02:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238171, 609946, 41337, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. I love the textures and how the colors match making the popcorn stand out. I''d imagine if you were able to get the popcorn a little higher so that we could see the pug''s eyes you would have done even better. However as is it gets high marks from me. Good luck.</td>', 'Cool shot. I love the textures and how the colors match making the popcorn stand out. I''d imagine if you were able to get the popcorn a little higher so that we could see the pug''s eyes you would have done even better. However as is it gets high marks from me. Good luck.', '2007-11-11 02:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238172, 609188, 30490, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective, and idea, but it doesn''t really work all that well for me.... I think I would have found the image more appealing if we weren''t looking up the rocket.  But I''m not entirely sure.</td>', 'Interesting perspective, and idea, but it doesn''t really work all that well for me.... I think I would have found the image more appealing if we weren''t looking up the rocket.  But I''m not entirely sure.', '2007-11-11 02:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238173, 609466, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.</td>', 'Nice idea.', '2007-11-11 02:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238174, 606874, 30490, '<td valign="top">Interesting twist on the challenge, but since it is a popcorn challenge, I kind of expect to see popcorn in the image...</td>', 'Interesting twist on the challenge, but since it is a popcorn challenge, I kind of expect to see popcorn in the image...', '2007-11-11 02:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238176, 606898, 30490, '<td valign="top">I agree, I prefer my popcorn naked or with a touch of butter, this food coloring stuff is just gross.  As for the image its a little soft on the focus and that will most likely hurt you in the voting...</td>', 'I agree, I prefer my popcorn naked or with a touch of butter, this food coloring stuff is just gross.  As for the image its a little soft on the focus and that will most likely hurt you in the voting...', '2007-11-11 02:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238177, 608860, 41337, '<td valign="top">Well that''s different. I suppose some burnt popcorn could have also worked as a fire victim. :P</td>', 'Well that''s different. I suppose some burnt popcorn could have also worked as a fire victim. :P', '2007-11-11 02:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238178, 609880, 30490, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, but a little soft on focus in my opinion.</td>', 'Cute idea, but a little soft on focus in my opinion.', '2007-11-11 02:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238179, 606928, 30490, '<td valign="top">Gee is that where you can buy that disgusting looking popcorn?  We don''t have it here in the states.... Great idea for an image, very unique.  A little soft on the focus though.</td>', 'Gee is that where you can buy that disgusting looking popcorn?  We don''t have it here in the states.... Great idea for an image, very unique.  A little soft on the focus though.', '2007-11-11 02:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238180, 609940, 41337, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to see the detail. I''m not sure if it just needs to be viewed at a larger size or if it''s a case of too much over exposure. I like the concept though! Good luck.</td>', 'It''s hard to see the detail. I''m not sure if it just needs to be viewed at a larger size or if it''s a case of too much over exposure. I like the concept though! Good luck.', '2007-11-11 02:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238181, 608571, 30490, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm, well this was a unique idea that just didn''t work out all that well. I think you were going for a soft impressionistic feel, and ended up with a kind of greasy mess. It was worth a try though... it just didn''t work for me.</td>', 'Hmmmm, well this was a unique idea that just didn''t work out all that well. I think you were going for a soft impressionistic feel, and ended up with a kind of greasy mess. It was worth a try though... it just didn''t work for me.', '2007-11-11 02:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238182, 608842, 30490, '<td valign="top">The "motion" of the popcorn just isn''t working for me, knowing that this is microwave popcorn and you can''t see it pop under normal conditions....  I know I am being picky, but it wasn''t a bad idea overall.</td>', 'The "motion" of the popcorn just isn''t working for me, knowing that this is microwave popcorn and you can''t see it pop under normal conditions....  I know I am being picky, but it wasn''t a bad idea overall.', '2007-11-11 02:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238183, 608816, 30490, '<td valign="top">Focus is too soft in my opinion.  The front kernals on the table is the only thing in focus and it just kind of hurt my eyes to look at the image.</td>', 'Focus is too soft in my opinion.  The front kernals on the table is the only thing in focus and it just kind of hurt my eyes to look at the image.', '2007-11-11 02:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238185, 609895, 30490, '<td valign="top">Good try, I think I would have liked this image better without the motion blur...</td>', 'Good try, I think I would have liked this image better without the motion blur...', '2007-11-11 02:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
