(4238192, 609922, 41337, '<td valign="top">Refreshing to see a different take on the challenge. It could use a little more of that explosive feel though. Like with fireworks its more interesting when they are caught shooting upward and exploding rather than falling back down.</td>', 'Refreshing to see a different take on the challenge. It could use a little more of that explosive feel though. Like with fireworks its more interesting when they are caught shooting upward and exploding rather than falling back down.', '2007-11-11 02:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
