(4238209, 608099, 30490, '<td valign="top">This must have been at sunrise, the sky looks just beautiful.  A great entry and an overall great image!</td>', 'This must have been at sunrise, the sky looks just beautiful.  A great entry and an overall great image!', '2007-11-11 02:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238210, 609335, 30490, '<td valign="top">Nice job, great job with the layout and actual photography of the popcorn, this looks like something I would actually eat (which was very rare in this challenge!)</td>', 'Nice job, great job with the layout and actual photography of the popcorn, this looks like something I would actually eat (which was very rare in this challenge!)', '2007-11-11 02:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238211, 609549, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. There''s another shot that shows them in the air, which I think gives it more dynamics. However, yours has more detail and tonal quality. I think a merger of the two ideas would have yielded the best shot.</td>', 'Nice idea. There''s another shot that shows them in the air, which I think gives it more dynamics. However, yours has more detail and tonal quality. I think a merger of the two ideas would have yielded the best shot.', '2007-11-11 02:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
