(4238213, 608842, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the sense of movement and the use of a narrow DOF. I think this would have worked better as a b/w especially given the blown highlights.</td>', 'I like the sense of movement and the use of a narrow DOF. I think this would have worked better as a b/w especially given the blown highlights.', '2007-11-11 02:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238214, 609281, 41337, '<td valign="top">Interesting take. This definitely has a Sherpet feel to it. I''m not sure if the lighting works here. I like the shadows but it feels a little too harsh on some of the lighter colored popcorn.</td>', 'Interesting take. This definitely has a Sherpet feel to it. I''m not sure if the lighting works here. I like the shadows but it feels a little too harsh on some of the lighter colored popcorn.', '2007-11-11 02:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238216, 609411, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the vintage take. I might have played that up some more in the presentation. For example, saturate the colors so that they look like those old metal signages you see in five and dime stores.</td>', 'I like the vintage take. I might have played that up some more in the presentation. For example, saturate the colors so that they look like those old metal signages you see in five and dime stores.', '2007-11-11 02:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238218, 609732, 41337, '<td valign="top">Simple yet interesting. For some reason the smudges and dust specks make the shot for me.</td>', 'Simple yet interesting. For some reason the smudges and dust specks make the shot for me.', '2007-11-11 02:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
