(4238746, 609961, 68454, '<td valign="top">Popcorn''s never looked so good :)<br/> <br/>The blur along the model''s left side, and at the bottom right seems unnatural to me, and I find it pulls my eye away from your subject.  Might''ve cropped out the bit of purple at the top left as well.</td>', 'Popcorn''s never looked so good :) The blur along the model''s left side, and at the bottom right seems unnatural to me, and I find it pulls my eye away from your subject.  Might''ve cropped out the bit of purple at the top left as well.', '2007-11-11 17:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238755, 606898, 68454, '<td valign="top">Difficult to find a focal point here.  Can''t say multi-color popcorn looks appealing to me either!</td>', 'Difficult to find a focal point here.  Can''t say multi-color popcorn looks appealing to me either!', '2007-11-11 17:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238770, 608099, 68454, '<td valign="top">Lacks composition IMO.  It''s just kind of there.  Perhaps shooting the stalks at an angle, and eliminating the stray stalks along frame right.  Focus seems a little soft too, although that could be the lens.</td>', 'Lacks composition IMO.  It''s just kind of there.  Perhaps shooting the stalks at an angle, and eliminating the stray stalks along frame right.  Focus seems a little soft too, although that could be the lens.', '2007-11-11 17:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238782, 608816, 68454, '<td valign="top">Would''ve preferred a little more DOF here, and a little different foreground composition, to better lead my eye into the photo.  Is that a pillow in the b/g  that matches the bowl?</td>', 'Would''ve preferred a little more DOF here, and a little different foreground composition, to better lead my eye into the photo.  Is that a pillow in the b/g  that matches the bowl?', '2007-11-11 17:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238784, 609281, 52472, '<td valign="top">Really clever! The lighting is a bit hard, but I love it anyway! 9</td>', 'Really clever! The lighting is a bit hard, but I love it anyway! 9', '2007-11-11 17:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238791, 608656, 68454, '<td valign="top">The slightly off-center composition bugs me, and I think this may have been better served with all the popcorn being in focus.  I like the idea though.</td>', 'The slightly off-center composition bugs me, and I think this may have been better served with all the popcorn being in focus.  I like the idea though.', '2007-11-11 17:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238798, 608607, 68454, '<td valign="top">What a cutie.  Nice DOF, nice colors.  I love her facial expression!</td>', 'What a cutie.  Nice DOF, nice colors.  I love her facial expression!', '2007-11-11 17:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238807, 609691, 68454, '<td valign="top">Looks like you''ve captured some nice texture on the popped kernels, but they''re flirting with the edge of focus, and the makes it hard to tell.  A bump in contrast, IMO, would''ve helped it "pop" (pun intended) also.</td>', 'Looks like you''ve captured some nice texture on the popped kernels, but they''re flirting with the edge of focus, and the makes it hard to tell.  A bump in contrast, IMO, would''ve helped it "pop" (pun intended) also.', '2007-11-11 17:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238817, 609411, 68454, '<td valign="top">That''s either really big popcorn, or a really little cart.:)  Nice focus and colors.  Two little things bug me, though.  The little triangle near the bottom right, and the left side of the case leaning to the right.  Otherwise, nice photo.</td>', 'That''s either really big popcorn, or a really little cart.:)  Nice focus and colors.  Two little things bug me, though.  The little triangle near the bottom right, and the left side of the case leaning to the right.  Otherwise, nice photo.', '2007-11-11 17:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238829, 609883, 68454, '<td valign="top">Creative idea.  Nice, crisp focus.  My only nitpicks would be the white dot near the top left, and the bottom left kernel being in shadow.</td>', 'Creative idea.  Nice, crisp focus.  My only nitpicks would be the white dot near the top left, and the bottom left kernel being in shadow.', '2007-11-11 17:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238834, 609287, 68454, '<td valign="top">Those eyes creep me out.  The cords and the chair leg are rather distracting, and the conversion is a bit flat.  Perhaps a contrast boost, and some level adjustments would help.</td>', 'Those eyes creep me out.  The cords and the chair leg are rather distracting, and the conversion is a bit flat.  Perhaps a contrast boost, and some level adjustments would help.', '2007-11-11 17:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238842, 609938, 68454, '<td valign="top">Quite the paint job.  Nice job keeping your reflection out, or did it get cropped? ;)</td>', 'Quite the paint job.  Nice job keeping your reflection out, or did it get cropped? ;)', '2007-11-11 17:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238850, 609610, 68454, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  For all the set-up time involved in this, I would''ve preferred to see the shadows less prominent.  Especially the shadow from the bottle across your model''s arm.  Lovely model, by the way.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  For all the set-up time involved in this, I would''ve preferred to see the shadows less prominent.  Especially the shadow from the bottle across your model''s arm.  Lovely model, by the way.', '2007-11-11 17:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238900, 609609, 61073, '<td valign="top">No Popcorn??</td>', 'No Popcorn??', '2007-11-11 18:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238901, 608607, 61073, '<td valign="top">Vibrant colors and cute photo..</td>', 'Vibrant colors and cute photo..', '2007-11-11 18:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4238902, 608656, 61073, '<td valign="top">Oh I love that bowl! I know someone with that set. Anyway, nice focus on the popcorn..good job.</td>', 'Oh I love that bowl! I know someone with that set. Anyway, nice focus on the popcorn..good job.', '2007-11-11 18:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
