(4239676, 609961, 32968, '<td valign="top">She looks completely engrossed in a movie, surrounded by the best movie snack! Great idea. 8</td>', 'She looks completely engrossed in a movie, surrounded by the best movie snack! Great idea. 8', '2007-11-12 00:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239681, 608099, 32968, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t make you think popcorn, but it''s still a pretty picture.</td>', 'Doesn''t make you think popcorn, but it''s still a pretty picture.', '2007-11-12 00:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239682, 609204, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh in the background, but not enough focus on the foreground.</td>', 'Nice bokeh in the background, but not enough focus on the foreground.', '2007-11-12 00:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239684, 609204, 32968, '<td valign="top">A little bit dark and fuzzy, but an excellent idea.</td>', 'A little bit dark and fuzzy, but an excellent idea.', '2007-11-12 00:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239709, 609940, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good concept.  It''s kind of washed out.</td>', 'Good concept.  It''s kind of washed out.', '2007-11-12 00:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239713, 609834, 19831, '<td valign="top">I think this could be a good choice of subject for this challenge, and has some potential. I think this particular shot has some things holding it back. For one, the lighting is even, but kind of flat. I think if you used a stronger light source, and perhaps had it at an angle to the corn, it would bring out texture, and depth, and create more interest. Also, the shot seems like it could be sharper. Maybe a bit smaller aperture? Looks like some USM in post would even help. Also I think the pov, from just straight above the corn, is lacking some dynamics. Maybe a different angle could be stronger?</td>', 'I think this could be a good choice of subject for this challenge, and has some potential. I think this particular shot has some things holding it back. For one, the lighting is even, but kind of flat. I think if you used a stronger light source, and perhaps had it at an angle to the corn, it would bring out texture, and depth, and create more interest. Also, the shot seems like it could be sharper. Maybe a bit smaller aperture? Looks like some USM in post would even help. Also I think the pov, from just straight above the corn, is lacking some dynamics. Maybe a different angle could be stronger?', '2007-11-12 00:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239731, 609210, 76430, '<td valign="top">Old what?</td>', 'Old what?', '2007-11-12 00:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239739, 609635, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice foreground, but the background needs lots of work, especially with the outlet considering it''s not used by the popper.</td>', 'Nice foreground, but the background needs lots of work, especially with the outlet considering it''s not used by the popper.', '2007-11-12 00:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239772, 609788, 19831, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. Great lighting. Nice job. I could see this as a poster. :-)</td>', 'Cute idea. Great lighting. Nice job. I could see this as a poster. :-)', '2007-11-12 01:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239811, 609852, 76430, '<td valign="top">Is this the same mini popcorn machine we saw in someone else''s entry?  Good composition and focus.</td>', 'Is this the same mini popcorn machine we saw in someone else''s entry?  Good composition and focus.', '2007-11-12 01:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239838, 609610, 76430, '<td valign="top">Very nice attempt, but the lighting detracts from it.  A second strobe or reflector on the left would help.</td>', 'Very nice attempt, but the lighting detracts from it.  A second strobe or reflector on the left would help.', '2007-11-12 01:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239887, 608735, 84907, '<td valign="top">Nice detail on a close shot.  Great choice on a background that adds rather than detracts from the shot.</td>', 'Nice detail on a close shot.  Great choice on a background that adds rather than detracts from the shot.', '2007-11-12 01:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239889, 609678, 84907, '<td valign="top">:)  Unique use of the subject.  Some people probably won''t realize the time and effort necessary to color all that corn  :)  Way to think outside the box!</td>', ':)  Unique use of the subject.  Some people probably won''t realize the time and effort necessary to color all that corn  :)  Way to think outside the box!', '2007-11-12 01:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239891, 608570, 84907, '<td valign="top">I love it.  Could be a strong but clearly I would never know and wouldn''t care.  The capture is great and using the gas stove makes the shot.  Well executed on an excellent sharp image.</td>', 'I love it.  Could be a strong but clearly I would never know and wouldn''t care.  The capture is great and using the gas stove makes the shot.  Well executed on an excellent sharp image.', '2007-11-12 01:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239893, 608045, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the thought.  Hope you didn''t get burned :)   The right piece looks a little OOF IMHO.  But a great shot and deserving of a very good score.</td>', 'I like the thought.  Hope you didn''t get burned :)   The right piece looks a little OOF IMHO.  But a great shot and deserving of a very good score.', '2007-11-12 01:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239895, 609883, 84907, '<td valign="top">The white dot in the upper left is throwing me for a bit of a loop.  I like the original thought with the shot.  A very nice capture.</td>', 'The white dot in the upper left is throwing me for a bit of a loop.  I like the original thought with the shot.  A very nice capture.', '2007-11-12 01:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239902, 609063, 84907, '<td valign="top">:)  Fun and family filled.  I like the thought and the execution of the shot.  The lighting coming from the right lights our young friend quite a bit but doesn''t hit the rest of the shot with the same oof because he is wearing a white shirt.  Still a fun image well done.</td>', ':)  Fun and family filled.  I like the thought and the execution of the shot.  The lighting coming from the right lights our young friend quite a bit but doesn''t hit the rest of the shot with the same oof because he is wearing a white shirt.  Still a fun image well done.', '2007-11-12 01:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239905, 609922, 84907, '<td valign="top">A unique and interesting shot.  There is a bit too much top room on this shot for my personal taste, but the effort to get this one and nail it clearly mitigates the framing issues I have.  Great creativity!</td>', 'A unique and interesting shot.  There is a bit too much top room on this shot for my personal taste, but the effort to get this one and nail it clearly mitigates the framing issues I have.  Great creativity!', '2007-11-12 01:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239909, 608833, 84907, '<td valign="top">Crisp sharp shot.  I like the lighting angle.  You will probably get dinged by many because there isn''t a wow factor, but this is very solid and the lighting makes it stick out for me.  Well prepared shot.</td>', 'Crisp sharp shot.  I like the lighting angle.  You will probably get dinged by many because there isn''t a wow factor, but this is very solid and the lighting makes it stick out for me.  Well prepared shot.', '2007-11-12 01:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239914, 609732, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the thought for this one.  The additional moving matter (I assume it is oil or popcorn fragments) that is flying over the piece to left is pretty distracting to me personally.  The framing is very good.  Just right on the left to right and the up and down for me.</td>', 'I like the thought for this one.  The additional moving matter (I assume it is oil or popcorn fragments) that is flying over the piece to left is pretty distracting to me personally.  The framing is very good.  Just right on the left to right and the up and down for me.', '2007-11-12 01:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239923, 609820, 84907, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail shot.  Not sure how you made a popcorn ball  :)  Actually the closer I look the more I see how you made the popcorn ball.  I see something under the spider''s middle right leg that looks like fishing line.  At first I thought it was feeler hair on the spider but it couldn''t come out at that angle.  Not sure what it is but my eye catches it.  HOWEVER, that is a nitpicky.  Meaning it doesn''t really impact my scoring on a very nice capture with a fun twist.</td>', 'Very nice detail shot.  Not sure how you made a popcorn ball  :)  Actually the closer I look the more I see how you made the popcorn ball.  I see something under the spider''s middle right leg that looks like fishing line.  At first I thought it was feeler hair on the spider but it couldn''t come out at that angle.  Not sure what it is but my eye catches it.  HOWEVER, that is a nitpicky.  Meaning it doesn''t really impact my scoring on a very nice capture with a fun twist.', '2007-11-12 01:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239927, 609864, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the frozen capture.  Many have tried the movement and it doesn''t work for me as much as this does.  The framing of the shot distracts me a bit on this one.  It won''t hurt my scoring on this one, but the left bottom with the grey whatever that is immediately catches my eye as does the right half of the pan with the handle or whatever that is coming off.  I would say either crop or get in closer oooooorrrrr pan it out so we know what that is so it can be mentally placed so it isn''t a distraction.  But as I said not going to hurt your score with me just something of a comment because really the comments are just as important as the scores.</td>', 'I like the frozen capture.  Many have tried the movement and it doesn''t work for me as much as this does.  The framing of the shot distracts me a bit on this one.  It won''t hurt my scoring on this one, but the left bottom with the grey whatever that is immediately catches my eye as does the right half of the pan with the handle or whatever that is coming off.  I would say either crop or get in closer oooooorrrrr pan it out so we know what that is so it can be mentally placed so it isn''t a distraction.  But as I said not going to hurt your score with me just something of a comment because really the comments are just as important as the scores.', '2007-11-12 01:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239931, 609938, 84907, '<td valign="top">LOL I hear the "is this real popcorn crowd" coming for this one.  I like the shot and its score will not suffer from me thats for sure.  I like the shot and the only thing I would point out is the right side between the headlight and the popcorn skin on the car has some reflection (I think thats what it is) that immediately draws my attention.  The only issue with that is that it takes away from what is a good shot.  So survive the "no popcorn" quotes  :)  Good job.</td>', 'LOL I hear the "is this real popcorn crowd" coming for this one.  I like the shot and its score will not suffer from me thats for sure.  I like the shot and the only thing I would point out is the right side between the headlight and the popcorn skin on the car has some reflection (I think thats what it is) that immediately draws my attention.  The only issue with that is that it takes away from what is a good shot.  So survive the "no popcorn" quotes  :)  Good job.', '2007-11-12 01:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239934, 609834, 84907, '<td valign="top">Not a ton to this shot, but a nice job with it.  I like the set up of the kernels.  Gives you depth and distance to the shot.  I am sure some will ding you for lack of wow factor, but a very nice solid shot.</td>', 'Not a ton to this shot, but a nice job with it.  I like the set up of the kernels.  Gives you depth and distance to the shot.  I am sure some will ding you for lack of wow factor, but a very nice solid shot.', '2007-11-12 01:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239939, 608860, 84907, '<td valign="top">Nice  :)  It appears the deceased lost bodily control after death with the soiled spot under them.  :)   I love the creativity and thought process on the shot.  Would have liked to seen this on a darker background for a chalk line effect, but that would have made the limbs difficult to make.  A very nice job and I assure you I appreciate the smile it brought to my face.</td>', 'Nice  :)  It appears the deceased lost bodily control after death with the soiled spot under them.  :)   I love the creativity and thought process on the shot.  Would have liked to seen this on a darker background for a chalk line effect, but that would have made the limbs difficult to make.  A very nice job and I assure you I appreciate the smile it brought to my face.', '2007-11-12 01:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239944, 609794, 84907, '<td valign="top">Nice solid shot.  No huge WOW factor, but I don''t think that is what you were going for.  Good lighting, good use of challenge, and good composition.  I would say think about turning the bag a little to give it more detail you can bring out but a nice solid shot.</td>', 'Nice solid shot.  No huge WOW factor, but I don''t think that is what you were going for.  Good lighting, good use of challenge, and good composition.  I would say think about turning the bag a little to give it more detail you can bring out but a nice solid shot.', '2007-11-12 02:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239951, 609755, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like it.  A nice take on the challenge.  Nitpicky me says the yellow string at the top of the frame holding the stalks together is an easy crop out so we don''t see that distraction.  However I love the character the building brings into the shot and the compostion is very very nice.</td>', 'I like it.  A nice take on the challenge.  Nitpicky me says the yellow string at the top of the frame holding the stalks together is an easy crop out so we don''t see that distraction.  However I love the character the building brings into the shot and the compostion is very very nice.', '2007-11-12 02:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239961, 609610, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the interesting take to think outside the box.  The lighting here distracts me.  The image will still rank just fine with me, but the lighting shadows distract me from what the title suggests as the focus of the shot.  Additionally the closed eyes on your checker queen doesn''t give you as good of a shot as what you had set up.</td>', 'I like the interesting take to think outside the box.  The lighting here distracts me.  The image will still rank just fine with me, but the lighting shadows distract me from what the title suggests as the focus of the shot.  Additionally the closed eyes on your checker queen doesn''t give you as good of a shot as what you had set up.', '2007-11-12 02:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239967, 609387, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the different take.</td>', 'I like the different take.', '2007-11-12 02:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239975, 609431, 84907, '<td valign="top">Careful not to stick yourself going in for the popcorn, or the scissors for that matter.  Not sure how big this was originally, but some pixellation on the left near the Burt''s Bee''s hurts the image a little.  However a great take on the theme!</td>', 'Careful not to stick yourself going in for the popcorn, or the scissors for that matter.  Not sure how big this was originally, but some pixellation on the left near the Burt''s Bee''s hurts the image a little.  However a great take on the theme!', '2007-11-12 02:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239981, 609657, 84907, '<td valign="top">LOL nice.  With an image this stark anything other than your subjects and the background will immediately draw attention.  So, in the bottom left there as small as that is my eye immediately goes there.  Still a nice job on a very different take.</td>', 'LOL nice.  With an image this stark anything other than your subjects and the background will immediately draw attention.  So, in the bottom left there as small as that is my eye immediately goes there.  Still a nice job on a very different take.', '2007-11-12 02:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239988, 609961, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the different use of the theme on this one.  One of the better ones in this challenge.  One thing I will say though is the lighting is almost overpowering for my taste.  Your model while perfect for this and very well posed loses all definition on her left side (pictures right).  Her nose on that side blends into her face and hurts the image in my opinion.  Still a great shot and well set up.</td>', 'I like the different use of the theme on this one.  One of the better ones in this challenge.  One thing I will say though is the lighting is almost overpowering for my taste.  Your model while perfect for this and very well posed loses all definition on her left side (pictures right).  Her nose on that side blends into her face and hurts the image in my opinion.  Still a great shot and well set up.', '2007-11-12 02:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239996, 608842, 84907, '<td valign="top">Fun shot!  There are some focus issues on the ACT II box that are clearly caused by the motion.  Still a nice shot but the not fully frozen frozen motion and the lack of clarity on the box hurt a little.</td>', 'Fun shot!  There are some focus issues on the ACT II box that are clearly caused by the motion.  Still a nice shot but the not fully frozen frozen motion and the lack of clarity on the box hurt a little.', '2007-11-12 02:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4239999, 609898, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting on this one.  Well used to keep the focus where you want it while keeping the lighting from overpowering the shot.</td>', 'I like the lighting on this one.  Well used to keep the focus where you want it while keeping the lighting from overpowering the shot.', '2007-11-12 02:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240003, 609852, 84907, '<td valign="top">A classic combo. . . or something like that they say at the theatre.  Well executed.  A bit of glare on top of the Coke can, but nothing worth losing score for.  Nice job and I really like the composition.</td>', 'A classic combo. . . or something like that they say at the theatre.  Well executed.  A bit of glare on top of the Coke can, but nothing worth losing score for.  Nice job and I really like the composition.', '2007-11-12 02:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240011, 607614, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the shot.  Two things I would like to point out immediately caught my attention in the shot that distract from the image.  #1 in the middle of the glass there appears to be a scratch.  #2 a diagonal line in the background heading from glass middle off to the right.  Are these picky??  Yes.  They will not greatly impacting my scoring, but I always love comments that give me something to think about and work on rather than the score only.</td>', 'I like the shot.  Two things I would like to point out immediately caught my attention in the shot that distract from the image.  #1 in the middle of the glass there appears to be a scratch.  #2 a diagonal line in the background heading from glass middle off to the right.  Are these picky??  Yes.  They will not greatly impacting my scoring, but I always love comments that give me something to think about and work on rather than the score only.', '2007-11-12 02:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240014, 609691, 84907, '<td valign="top">Nice solid shot.  No big frills, but lighting and composition are good.</td>', 'Nice solid shot.  No big frills, but lighting and composition are good.', '2007-11-12 02:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240015, 609215, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the thought.</td>', 'I like the thought.', '2007-11-12 02:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240019, 608099, 84907, '<td valign="top">I can hear the evil does not meet crowd coming.  I am not going to say that.  I would rather focus on the shot and talk about that.  In the upper right the tree branch or whatever that is immediately takes my attention away from your shot.  Same thing with the two stalk tops that break in from the right side.  If you were looking to shoot through the corn into the sunset I would say get the camera up higher and shoot truly through the corn into the sunset rather than up into both.</td>', 'I can hear the evil does not meet crowd coming.  I am not going to say that.  I would rather focus on the shot and talk about that.  In the upper right the tree branch or whatever that is immediately takes my attention away from your shot.  Same thing with the two stalk tops that break in from the right side.  If you were looking to shoot through the corn into the sunset I would say get the camera up higher and shoot truly through the corn into the sunset rather than up into both.', '2007-11-12 02:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240020, 609335, 84907, '<td valign="top">Nice solid shot.  I am sure some people will ding it for lack of wow, but not this voter.  Just a very well executed shot.</td>', 'Nice solid shot.  I am sure some people will ding it for lack of wow, but not this voter.  Just a very well executed shot.', '2007-11-12 02:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240023, 609940, 84907, '<td valign="top">A little washed out for my taste as you lose some of the popcorn with such a white background.  Black or a different color would have helped immensely.  But great thought and creativity.</td>', 'A little washed out for my taste as you lose some of the popcorn with such a white background.  Black or a different color would have helped immensely.  But great thought and creativity.', '2007-11-12 02:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240028, 608816, 84907, '<td valign="top">For me choosing to focus on the first two corn pops there means the entire rest of the shot is OOF.  An interesting choice.  It doesn''t work for me because the vast entirety of the shot is OOF, but I like the bold choice to go that way.</td>', 'For me choosing to focus on the first two corn pops there means the entire rest of the shot is OOF.  An interesting choice.  It doesn''t work for me because the vast entirety of the shot is OOF, but I like the bold choice to go that way.', '2007-11-12 02:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240031, 609755, 58438, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  I see little room for improvement but if I had to pick something, it would be to remove the shovel leaning against the structure.  Some may see it as a distraction even though it is not very distracting to me.</td>', 'Very creative.  I see little room for improvement but if I had to pick something, it would be to remove the shovel leaning against the structure.  Some may see it as a distraction even though it is not very distracting to me.', '2007-11-12 02:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240032, 606928, 84907, '<td valign="top">NICE.  Not even from Aussie land and I like this one.  Nice shot and a very nice job of getting the shot without getting a ton of reflection off the wood from your lighting.</td>', 'NICE.  Not even from Aussie land and I like this one.  Nice shot and a very nice job of getting the shot without getting a ton of reflection off the wood from your lighting.', '2007-11-12 02:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240034, 609691, 58438, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit soft to me but I am no expert. Nice color.</td>', 'Seems a bit soft to me but I am no expert. Nice color.', '2007-11-12 02:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240037, 606874, 84907, '<td valign="top">Well, I am sure this is going to get dinged for meeting challenge, but I would rather give my thoughts on the shot.  It is a very good shot.  I think that a little lower POV might have given you  less shadow on the second flower and would have helped with some of the focus issues on the lower half of the bottom flower.</td>', 'Well, I am sure this is going to get dinged for meeting challenge, but I would rather give my thoughts on the shot.  It is a very good shot.  I think that a little lower POV might have given you  less shadow on the second flower and would have helped with some of the focus issues on the lower half of the bottom flower.', '2007-11-12 02:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240040, 609656, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like it.  I think cropping it in closer to the pan would have helped the shot.  The upper right distracts from the shot quite a bit.  A very cool thought and I like it quite a bit.</td>', 'I like it.  I think cropping it in closer to the pan would have helped the shot.  The upper right distracts from the shot quite a bit.  A very cool thought and I like it quite a bit.', '2007-11-12 02:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240041, 608383, 58438, '<td valign="top">Love the idea.  The popcorn seems to be a little too bright.</td>', 'Love the idea.  The popcorn seems to be a little too bright.', '2007-11-12 02:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240047, 609287, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the shot and I understand the B&amp;W to get rid of the doggy eye green.  The flash also washed the popcorn out a bit lessening the details on all the corn.  I would say going with a vertical crop might have been a big help here and it also would have taken the desk or table leg and the cords out of the shot which are also a bit distracting.  Still like the shot and the fun of the dog with its own bowl though!</td>', 'I like the shot and I understand the B&W to get rid of the doggy eye green.  The flash also washed the popcorn out a bit lessening the details on all the corn.  I would say going with a vertical crop might have been a big help here and it also would have taken the desk or table leg and the cords out of the shot which are also a bit distracting.  Still like the shot and the fun of the dog with its own bowl though!', '2007-11-12 02:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240050, 609549, 58438, '<td valign="top">This is a very original idea, very detailed even though the white seems to be a little too bright to me. Love the reflection on the smallest kernel. The title says it all but it makes me think of "evolution".  I also like the reflection in the foreground.</td>', 'This is a very original idea, very detailed even though the white seems to be a little too bright to me. Love the reflection on the smallest kernel. The title says it all but it makes me think of "evolution".  I also like the reflection in the foreground.', '2007-11-12 02:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240053, 609364, 84907, '<td valign="top">Well, I am sure you will see some of the Does not meet comments, but thats not what I am here to do.  The shot is a good one.  The light being where it is doesn''t help with the near side details that could have made the shot even better.  Still nice shot and good luck with the does not meet comments.</td>', 'Well, I am sure you will see some of the Does not meet comments, but thats not what I am here to do.  The shot is a good one.  The light being where it is doesn''t help with the near side details that could have made the shot even better.  Still nice shot and good luck with the does not meet comments.', '2007-11-12 02:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240056, 609504, 58438, '<td valign="top">Tedious work, making popcorn.  Cute idea. I like the warm colors and the halo around the light.  Great detail.</td>', 'Tedious work, making popcorn.  Cute idea. I like the warm colors and the halo around the light.  Great detail.', '2007-11-12 02:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240058, 609880, 84907, '<td valign="top">A different take.  :)  A good shot.  There are a couple of spots where the popcorn doesn''t fully cover and that immediately grabs my eye.  Also there are some OOF issues on our fun plump little friend as well.  Still a nice shot and I like the thought!</td>', 'A different take.  :)  A good shot.  There are a couple of spots where the popcorn doesn''t fully cover and that immediately grabs my eye.  Also there are some OOF issues on our fun plump little friend as well.  Still a nice shot and I like the thought!', '2007-11-12 02:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240065, 609818, 84907, '<td valign="top">I am sure you are prepared for the does not meet crowd, but that is not the purpose of my vote or comment.  For me the image could be better with a couple of things.  First the flag in the bottom left is big time distraction.  Additionally, it seems to have messed a bit with focus.  Move right or get above it and that will dramatically improve this shot.</td>', 'I am sure you are prepared for the does not meet crowd, but that is not the purpose of my vote or comment.  For me the image could be better with a couple of things.  First the flag in the bottom left is big time distraction.  Additionally, it seems to have messed a bit with focus.  Move right or get above it and that will dramatically improve this shot.', '2007-11-12 02:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240069, 608656, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the take on the challenge.  Well framed up shot.</td>', 'I like the take on the challenge.  Well framed up shot.', '2007-11-12 02:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240070, 609895, 58438, '<td valign="top">Great detail and action!  If I had to be critical of something, it would have to be the inside right of the pot.  The shine there seems to be a little distracting to me but I do like the reflection of the popcorn in the same area.  Good catch.</td>', 'Great detail and action!  If I had to be critical of something, it would have to be the inside right of the pot.  The shine there seems to be a little distracting to me but I do like the reflection of the popcorn in the same area.  Good catch.', '2007-11-12 02:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
