(4240074, 608607, 84907, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of color and kids.  A winning combination.  Certainly on my top page so far.  Nice framing, lighting, and use of challenge.  Very nice.</td>', 'Excellent use of color and kids.  A winning combination.  Certainly on my top page so far.  Nice framing, lighting, and use of challenge.  Very nice.', '2007-11-12 02:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
