(4240089, 609719, 84907, '<td valign="top">An interesting way to present the shot.  I like the variety!  Good use of selective light.</td>', 'An interesting way to present the shot.  I like the variety!  Good use of selective light.', '2007-11-12 02:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
