(4240092, 609938, 58438, '<td valign="top">If this was already on the vehicle, WHAT A GREAT FIND for the subject!  If not, how did you do it!  I really like the shot and it is a pleasant entry after looking at all the edible ones (such as mine).  Mine is not a trained eye but I do not see any room for improvement.</td>', 'If this was already on the vehicle, WHAT A GREAT FIND for the subject!  If not, how did you do it!  I really like the shot and it is a pleasant entry after looking at all the edible ones (such as mine).  Mine is not a trained eye but I do not see any room for improvement.', '2007-11-12 02:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240093, 609281, 84907, '<td valign="top">:)  you gotta love pop take on art.  Nice shot and even better thought and creativity.</td>', ':)  you gotta love pop take on art.  Nice shot and even better thought and creativity.', '2007-11-12 02:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240098, 609635, 84907, '<td valign="top">My eye is immediately drawn to the outlet cover.  This is a good shot, but moving your shot to get a better background would have helped quite a bit.  Also being aware of what the reflection on the pot will do is very important.  Still a very nice shot.</td>', 'My eye is immediately drawn to the outlet cover.  This is a good shot, but moving your shot to get a better background would have helped quite a bit.  Also being aware of what the reflection on the pot will do is very important.  Still a very nice shot.', '2007-11-12 02:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240101, 608439, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like it  :)  I am sure some will be out for doesn''t meet on this one, but I really like the shot and the look on the face is priceless.  Great shot and use of what technically isn''t popcorn at all to look like it.  I really like it but am afraid I will be in the minority.</td>', 'I like it  :)  I am sure some will be out for doesn''t meet on this one, but I really like the shot and the look on the face is priceless.  Great shot and use of what technically isn''t popcorn at all to look like it.  I really like it but am afraid I will be in the minority.', '2007-11-12 02:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240103, 609734, 84907, '<td valign="top">Solid shot.  Wow factor?? No, but solid shot.</td>', 'Solid shot.  Wow factor?? No, but solid shot.', '2007-11-12 02:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240105, 609063, 58438, '<td valign="top">I like it because it reflects a warm family moment.  Great example of stopping time.  Who won the bite of popcorn?  My bet is on the boy.</td>', 'I like it because it reflects a warm family moment.  Great example of stopping time.  Who won the bite of popcorn?  My bet is on the boy.', '2007-11-12 02:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240106, 608571, 84907, '<td valign="top">Would love to see this focus the other way around.  Focus on the steamy treat with the buttered glass in the foreground.</td>', 'Would love to see this focus the other way around.  Focus on the steamy treat with the buttered glass in the foreground.', '2007-11-12 02:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240111, 608570, 58438, '<td valign="top">I really like this because of the blue flame.  It really adds to the warmth of the shot as well as the appearance of action.  How did you keep the popcorn from burning?  You must be a fast worker.  This is my favorite so far.</td>', 'I really like this because of the blue flame.  It really adds to the warmth of the shot as well as the appearance of action.  How did you keep the popcorn from burning?  You must be a fast worker.  This is my favorite so far.', '2007-11-12 02:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240114, 609617, 84907, '<td valign="top">LOL it already has the validated seal of approval on it.  :)  I like the shot.   I would love to see some description on how it was done.  I have an idea, but would love to see it.  Now on the shot.  The lighting hurts the shot a little for me.  The back of our popcorn pal especially the hair gets lost into the background which for some would probably be perfect but IMO it detracts.  Still a FUN FUN shot and I can''t wait to hear how you did it.</td>', 'LOL it already has the validated seal of approval on it.  :)  I like the shot.   I would love to see some description on how it was done.  I have an idea, but would love to see it.  Now on the shot.  The lighting hurts the shot a little for me.  The back of our popcorn pal especially the hair gets lost into the background which for some would probably be perfect but IMO it detracts.  Still a FUN FUN shot and I can''t wait to hear how you did it.', '2007-11-12 02:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240116, 609788, 84907, '<td valign="top">You have got to love the K9 involvement.  A very good shot.  Your table cover has some lint issues on the right side that draw attention pretty quickly away from a very very nice shot.  Great job.</td>', 'You have got to love the K9 involvement.  A very good shot.  Your table cover has some lint issues on the right side that draw attention pretty quickly away from a very very nice shot.  Great job.', '2007-11-12 02:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240118, 609871, 84907, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the lighting on this one.  I would say if you are going this direction I would like to see uniform lighting on all the corn.</td>', 'Not a fan of the lighting on this one.  I would say if you are going this direction I would like to see uniform lighting on all the corn.', '2007-11-12 02:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4240120, 609411, 84907, '<td valign="top">:)  The scale confuses me quite a bit here  :)  Still a great shot and very well done.</td>', ':)  The scale confuses me quite a bit here  :)  Still a great shot and very well done.', '2007-11-12 02:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
