(4240126, 609609, 84907, '<td valign="top">I won''t give the doesn''t meet speech and will rather talk about the shot.  The shot is fabulous.  Cropping is very very good and the image is tack sharp.  I really like this one.</td>', 'I won''t give the doesn''t meet speech and will rather talk about the shot.  The shot is fabulous.  Cropping is very very good and the image is tack sharp.  I really like this one.', '2007-11-12 02:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
