(4240346, 609961, 86540, '<td valign="top">Catching, great exposure and color, excites senses..... finally a pic that has it going on.  And the superiority it honestly has little to do with the girl either, although she definantly draws you in with her enticing eyes. This picture just made me twitch, while most other pics made me snore.  Also the popcorn use is actually relevant, both as an active prop and in a "stimulating" manner.  Perhaps if the model was a bit more exposed, but keeping it pg, this pic could be even better; but regardless, you get my first 10.</td>', 'Catching, great exposure and color, excites senses..... finally a pic that has it going on.  And the superiority it honestly has little to do with the girl either, although she definantly draws you in with her enticing eyes. This picture just made me twitch, while most other pics made me snore.  Also the popcorn use is actually relevant, both as an active prop and in a "stimulating" manner.  Perhaps if the model was a bit more exposed, but keeping it pg, this pic could be even better; but regardless, you get my first 10.', '2007-11-12 06:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
