(4241529, 609818, 811, '<td valign="top">Good picture.  Especially poignant since I am voting on Veteran''s day.  I like how you have captured a "tough" guy in a less than "tough" stance.  That said, it is a bit of a stretch for the challenge (but I *can* see where you are coming from) and his face/hair and a couple of other spots look a bit oversharpened.</td>', 'Good picture.  Especially poignant since I am voting on Veteran''s day.  I like how you have captured a "tough" guy in a less than "tough" stance.  That said, it is a bit of a stretch for the challenge (but I *can* see where you are coming from) and his face/hair and a couple of other spots look a bit oversharpened.', '2007-11-12 15:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4241571, 609922, 39830, '<td valign="top">Very creative! Can''t wait to see the set up.</td>', 'Very creative! Can''t wait to see the set up.', '2007-11-12 15:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4241837, 608972, 84907, '<td valign="top">I love the creativity of the shot and the lighting adds to the intrigue of the shot.  Very nice job!  A top performer in the challenge for me.</td>', 'I love the creativity of the shot and the lighting adds to the intrigue of the shot.  Very nice job!  A top performer in the challenge for me.', '2007-11-12 17:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4241849, 609504, 84907, '<td valign="top">A nice solid shot.  I imagine capturing this was quite difficult.  A nice solid shot and it scores very well from me.</td>', 'A nice solid shot.  I imagine capturing this was quite difficult.  A nice solid shot and it scores very well from me.', '2007-11-12 17:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4241851, 609246, 84907, '<td valign="top">A nice take on the challenge.  Nothing sticks out as particularly bad but nothing that shoves it over the 6 mark for me either.  A nice solid and well constructed shot.</td>', 'A nice take on the challenge.  Nothing sticks out as particularly bad but nothing that shoves it over the 6 mark for me either.  A nice solid and well constructed shot.', '2007-11-12 17:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4241859, 609574, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the take on the challenge.  Good composition.   The leftmost popcorn has some OOF areas but nothing large enough to lose points from me.  on the really really nitpicky side the knife has something on it.  But in the end neither of those things impact my scoring in a significant way at all and this is a very nice solid and well composed shot.</td>', 'I like the take on the challenge.  Good composition.   The leftmost popcorn has some OOF areas but nothing large enough to lose points from me.  on the really really nitpicky side the knife has something on it.  But in the end neither of those things impact my scoring in a significant way at all and this is a very nice solid and well composed shot.', '2007-11-12 17:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4241865, 609466, 84907, '<td valign="top">Good solid shot.  Nice composition and the lighting really helps this shot pop.  While joke intended it also is a fact in this shot.  Well done indeed.</td>', 'Good solid shot.  Nice composition and the lighting really helps this shot pop.  While joke intended it also is a fact in this shot.  Well done indeed.', '2007-11-12 17:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4241868, 609549, 84907, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge and a nice solid shot.  I like the composition and the monochrome makes it stand out.  Very nice solid shot all around.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge and a nice solid shot.  I like the composition and the monochrome makes it stand out.  Very nice solid shot all around.', '2007-11-12 17:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4241871, 609895, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the motion thought on this shot.  This doesn''t blow me away because this challenge has lots of popcorn motion shots, but this is still very solid.  The bottom left in the shot gets lost a little with the lighting, but still just a very nice solid shot.</td>', 'I like the motion thought on this shot.  This doesn''t blow me away because this challenge has lots of popcorn motion shots, but this is still very solid.  The bottom left in the shot gets lost a little with the lighting, but still just a very nice solid shot.', '2007-11-12 17:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4241872, 609204, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF and the background blur.  Very nice job with this shot.  Nice and solid all around.</td>', 'I like the DOF and the background blur.  Very nice job with this shot.  Nice and solid all around.', '2007-11-12 18:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4241878, 609505, 84907, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  The admit tickets look a bit hokey for my personal taste, but the composition, and lighting are just excellent.  Very solid shot.  Technical side I just think it is a very solid shot.  I probably won''t jump off the page on the voting scale because it doesn''t have the "wow" factor, but the solid shot is a big plus from me.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  The admit tickets look a bit hokey for my personal taste, but the composition, and lighting are just excellent.  Very solid shot.  Technical side I just think it is a very solid shot.  I probably won''t jump off the page on the voting scale because it doesn''t have the "wow" factor, but the solid shot is a big plus from me.', '2007-11-12 18:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4241880, 609634, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like this capture.  My biggest issue with this one is the lighting.  I like the lighting on the main piece falling, but the impact of that lighting is that the reflection in the bowl is instantly distracting, and the popcorn in the bowl is lost as it is much less sharp than the rest of the image.  Still solid shot and I like the thought process on the shot.</td>', 'I like this capture.  My biggest issue with this one is the lighting.  I like the lighting on the main piece falling, but the impact of that lighting is that the reflection in the bowl is instantly distracting, and the popcorn in the bowl is lost as it is much less sharp than the rest of the image.  Still solid shot and I like the thought process on the shot.', '2007-11-12 18:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
