(4243616, 606898, 39679, '<td valign="top">One problem with onboard flashes is that, because they are so close to the lens, they tend to create shadowless images which look rather "flat".  This isn''t a bad shot but really does look flat.  I''d love to see you try it again but side lighted a little.  The nice thing about most digitals is that you can set the white balance which allows you to use almost any light you want.</td>', 'One problem with onboard flashes is that, because they are so close to the lens, they tend to create shadowless images which look rather "flat".  This isn''t a bad shot but really does look flat.  I''d love to see you try it again but side lighted a little.  The nice thing about most digitals is that you can set the white balance which allows you to use almost any light you want.', '2007-11-13 10:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
