(4246501, 608383, 68582, '<td valign="top">CONGRATS MICHELLE!!!!!!!!!!!!  WAY TO GO!!!!!!!!!!!<br/> <br/>What a thought with this one.  Oddly enough, even though I hadn''t seen what shot you''d entered (and, didn''t vote in this challenge), I just somehow had a notion that this might have been yours! :)  It had "outside the box" written all over it and that''s Mich''s! *grin*<br/> <br/>Hat is off to ya!  Keep up the great work! HUGS</td>', 'CONGRATS MICHELLE!!!!!!!!!!!!  WAY TO GO!!!!!!!!!!! What a thought with this one.  Oddly enough, even though I hadn''t seen what shot you''d entered (and, didn''t vote in this challenge), I just somehow had a notion that this might have been yours! :)  It had "outside the box" written all over it and that''s Mich''s! *grin* Hat is off to ya!  Keep up the great work! HUGS', '2007-11-14 10:34:48.000000', NULL, 0),
