(4246618, 608465, 85437, '<td valign="top">OK.. not bad for my first try, but I hope to improve.  Thanks for all the nice comments.</td>', 'OK.. not bad for my first try, but I hope to improve.  Thanks for all the nice comments.', '2007-11-14 11:03:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4246640, 609431, 67697, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a cute idea (I know what "I SPY" is lol) and I gave it a 6.  I did not score it higher because it seems to lack some sharpness or focus. (like it''s slightly slightly OOF)  Did you use a tripod?  Also everything seems flat, like some different lighting would have added a touch of depth and dimension.</td>', 'I thought this was a cute idea (I know what "I SPY" is lol) and I gave it a 6.  I did not score it higher because it seems to lack some sharpness or focus. (like it''s slightly slightly OOF)  Did you use a tripod?  Also everything seems flat, like some different lighting would have added a touch of depth and dimension.', '2007-11-14 11:08:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4246658, 608465, 37961, '<td valign="top">Woah...great shot and timing!!</td>', 'Woah...great shot and timing!!', '2007-11-14 11:12:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4246679, 607598, 11518, '<td valign="top">Well deserved!  Congrats!</td>', 'Well deserved!  Congrats!', '2007-11-14 11:18:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4246684, 608570, 11518, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your Red!  Well done!</td>', 'Congrats on your Red!  Well done!', '2007-11-14 11:19:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4246691, 609431, 76430, '<td valign="top">I didn''t see the I Spy movie, so I assume this is a memorable scene from it.  I used to watch the TV series I Spy back 100 years ago, but I didn''t connect it to the title.  I thought I was generous giving it a 5.  It just looked like a bunch of junk drawer stuff with popcorn dropped in the middle.  I guess you would have had to see the movie to appreciate it.</td>', 'I didn''t see the I Spy movie, so I assume this is a memorable scene from it.  I used to watch the TV series I Spy back 100 years ago, but I didn''t connect it to the title.  I thought I was generous giving it a 5.  It just looked like a bunch of junk drawer stuff with popcorn dropped in the middle.  I guess you would have had to see the movie to appreciate it.', '2007-11-14 11:23:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4246705, 609431, 58691, '<td valign="top">I think most commenters mentioned the contrast and sharpness. Also you could''ve bumped the colors up a bit (curves). I voted this a 5.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-11-14 11:29:48.</i></td>', 'I think most commenters mentioned the contrast and sharpness. Also you could''ve bumped the colors up a bit (curves). I voted this a 5.', '2007-11-14 11:28:46.000000', '2007-11-14 11:29:48.000000', 0),
(4246792, 608570, 56002, '<td valign="top">Rock on man - good for you!</td>', 'Rock on man - good for you!', '2007-11-14 11:59:10.000000', NULL, 0),
