(4246833, 607598, 79720, '<td valign="top">Great, great image. Like I said: Priceless. Wall-worthy.</td>', 'Great, great image. Like I said: Priceless. Wall-worthy.', '2007-11-14 12:14:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4246836, 609617, 79720, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you were rewarded for the setup with a ribbon. :-)</td>', 'I''m glad you were rewarded for the setup with a ribbon. :-)', '2007-11-14 12:15:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4246840, 609431, 70270, '<td valign="top">Great idea ... but you got hammered by the speed voters.  My daughters all loved the I Spy books when they were little.  One thing about those books is that the set ups are pretty involved, and there''s a lot to look at in the pictures other than the things you are trying to "spy."  It looks like you spent some time finding things for your set up, but your shot ended up looking more like a quick snapshot of your kitchen junk drawer (c''mon, admit it, you know we all have them!) with some popcorn thrown in.  A more careful set up with some attention to composition and storytelling (as in the I Spy books) would have scored much better.  Even still, the colors and selection of junk are nice and the idea is fantastic. I think this should have scored much better than it did, and it got more 1s, 2s and 3s than it should have.</td>', 'Great idea ... but you got hammered by the speed voters.  My daughters all loved the I Spy books when they were little.  One thing about those books is that the set ups are pretty involved, and there''s a lot to look at in the pictures other than the things you are trying to "spy."  It looks like you spent some time finding things for your set up, but your shot ended up looking more like a quick snapshot of your kitchen junk drawer (c''mon, admit it, you know we all have them!) with some popcorn thrown in.  A more careful set up with some attention to composition and storytelling (as in the I Spy books) would have scored much better.  Even still, the colors and selection of junk are nice and the idea is fantastic. I think this should have scored much better than it did, and it got more 1s, 2s and 3s than it should have.', '2007-11-14 12:16:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4246845, 609899, 79720, '<td valign="top">I was right. Nice shot, Doctor, and congrats on an HM.<br/> <br/><i><b>edit</b></i>: What, do you have these things in a terrarium or something?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-11-14 12:18:55.</i></td>', 'I was right. Nice shot, Doctor, and congrats on an HM. edit: What, do you have these things in a terrarium or something?', '2007-11-14 12:18:04.000000', '2007-11-14 12:18:55.000000', 0);
