(4368466, 608571, 30982, '<td valign="top">A decent sized gap between your final average and what the commenters average vote is indicates you''ve appealed well to a segment of the crowd.  In many instances, that''s my personal goal, since a lot of what I shoot doesn''t have mass appeal.  This is an extremely creative and different view of "popcorn" and something I would have voted high (had I voted this challenge.)  It''s clearly popcorn, it''s well composed, technicals are good.  The only nit is the red object which grabs the eye but doesn''t resolve into anything identifiable.  I really like the single popped kernel that seems lighter than all the rest.</td>', 'A decent sized gap between your final average and what the commenters average vote is indicates you''ve appealed well to a segment of the crowd.  In many instances, that''s my personal goal, since a lot of what I shoot doesn''t have mass appeal.  This is an extremely creative and different view of "popcorn" and something I would have voted high (had I voted this challenge.)  It''s clearly popcorn, it''s well composed, technicals are good.  The only nit is the red object which grabs the eye but doesn''t resolve into anything identifiable.  I really like the single popped kernel that seems lighter than all the rest.', '2008-01-07 01:49:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4421235, 609678, 49804, '<td valign="top">One reason on this for the poor score is that it has poor lighting. A very good investment would be to get a cheap speedlight (an offbrand one would do) that you can use to bounce light off of the ceiling which will make a lot better lighting. Also some people may see the idea as too "childish", just cause lots of people are looking for crazy creative ideas.</td>', 'One reason on this for the poor score is that it has poor lighting. A very good investment would be to get a cheap speedlight (an offbrand one would do) that you can use to bounce light off of the ceiling which will make a lot better lighting. Also some people may see the idea as too "childish", just cause lots of people are looking for crazy creative ideas.', '2008-01-24 11:57:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4422447, 609864, 49804, '<td valign="top">This is really awesome, great lighting, this also should''ve been an easy 6+, one thing that could''ve helped would be getting rid of the silver object in the bottom left, other than that though it is a stellar shot and very well done.</td>', 'This is really awesome, great lighting, this also should''ve been an easy 6+, one thing that could''ve helped would be getting rid of the silver object in the bottom left, other than that though it is a stellar shot and very well done.', '2008-01-24 18:32:08.000000', NULL, 0),
